# Project structure

Standard **Vite + React** layout at `apex-frontend/` root:

```
src/           Application source (@/ alias)
public/        Static files served as /
index.html     Vite HTML entry
vite.config.ts Dev :8080, build → dist/, /api proxy
```

## Path alias

- `@/*` → `src/*` (see `tsconfig.json` and `vite.config.ts`)
- Example: `import { Header } from "@/components/Header"`

## `src/` breakdown

- **`main.tsx`** — boots React, imports `global.css`
- **`App.tsx`** — `QueryClientProvider`, `AuthProvider`, routes, `Header` / `AppFooter` shell
- **`pages/`** — route components; `HomeRoute` switches `Index` vs `PublicHome`
- **`components/`** — shared UI (`ActivityCard`, `Header`, `profile/*`, `admin/*`, `ui/*`)
- **`features/`** — optional modules for complex flows (settings, session detail, manual activity)
- **`lib/`** — `api/` (HTTP client), `validation/`, `groupSessions.ts`, helpers
- **`auth/`** — route guards only (not login forms—those are under `pages/`)
- **`contexts/`** — `AuthContext`
- **`config/`** — `navigation.ts` (nav source of truth)

## API layer

- All HTTP to backend: **`src/lib/api/`**
- Add endpoints in domain files; export from `src/lib/api/index.ts` when shared
- Never import from deleted `shared/` or `server/` paths

## Config files (root)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `tailwind.config.ts` | Scans `./index.html`, `./src/**/*` |
| `eslint.config.js` | `src/**` = browser; `vite.config.ts` = node |
| `components.json` | shadcn paths → `src/global.css`, `@/components` |
| `vercel.json` | SPA hosting |

## Monorepo context

- Backend: sibling **`apex`** (Fastify, port 10000 default)
- This package: frontend only; no `DATABASE_URL` or Prisma here
